    <!-- 9 ISLAM -->
    <section class="screen" data-teach="islam">
      <span class="tag lo">Marriage &amp; the family</span>
      <h2>Christian views on marriage</h2>
      <p>Most Christians teach that <b>marriage</b> is a lifelong, committed union — traditionally between a man and a woman — created and blessed by God. It is seen as the right context for a sexual relationship and for raising children, though Christians differ on some points.</p>
